#: source/refs/issues.rst:8
msgid ""
"Each entry below names the backends it affects. An issue listed under one "
"backend does not apply to the others unless it says so."
msgstr "下列每个问题都注明了受影响的后端。某一后端下列出的问题，除非另有说明，否则不适用于其他后端。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:17
msgid "PhysX backends"
msgstr "PhysX 后端"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:20
msgid "Surface grippers require CPU simulation"
msgstr "表面夹爪需要在 CPU 上仿真"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:22
msgid "**Affects:** ``physics=isaacsim_physx`` surface-gripper tasks."
msgstr "**受影响范围：** 使用 ``physics=isaacsim_physx`` 的表面夹爪任务。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:24
msgid ""
"Surface grippers require CPU simulation. This includes the UR10 Long/Short "
"Suction stacking tasks, the Galbot Right Arm Suction stacking task, and its "
"relative and absolute Mimic variants. Pass ``--device cpu`` when running "
"teleoperation. Zero and random agents preserve these tasks' CPU defaults "
"when ``--device`` is omitted; an explicit GPU override is unsupported."
msgstr ""
"表面夹爪需要在 CPU 上仿真，包括 UR10 Long/Short Suction 堆叠任务、Galbot Right Arm Suction "
"堆叠任务，以及后者采用相对和绝对控制的 Mimic 变体。运行遥操作时请传入 ``--device cpu`` 。零动作和随机动作智能体在未指定 "
"``--device`` 时会保留这些任务默认的 CPU 设置；不支持显式改用 GPU。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:30
msgid "GPU articulation solver partition aliasing"
msgstr "GPU 关节体求解器分区别名问题"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Affects:** ``physics=isaacsim_physx`` on CUDA when "
"``PhysxCfg.gpu_max_num_partitions > 1``."
msgstr ""
"**受影响范围：** 在 CUDA 上运行且 ``PhysxCfg.gpu_max_num_partitions > 1`` 的 "
"``physics=isaacsim_physx`` 。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:35
msgid ""
"The PhysX GPU articulation solver can corrupt articulation state when a "
"scene contains more than 32 articulation instances and at least one "
"articulation has more than 64 links. The corruption can appear as runaway "
"joint velocities or NaNs in otherwise separate environments. See `Isaac Lab "
"issue #8121`_ for the reported repro."
msgstr ""
"当场景中有超过 32 个关节体实例，且至少一个关节体包含超过 64 个连杆时，PhysX GPU "
"关节体求解器可能破坏关节体状态。表现可能是本应互不影响的环境中，关节速度失控或出现 NaN。已报告的复现案例见 `Isaac Lab 问题 #8121 "
"<Isaac Lab issue #8121_>`_ 。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:40
msgid ""
"As a workaround, set ``PhysxCfg(gpu_max_num_partitions=1)`` until the "
"underlying PhysX issue is fixed. Isaac Lab logs a warning for managed PhysX "
":class:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation` assets when the known conditions are "
"detected."
msgstr ""
"在底层 PhysX 问题修复之前，可设置 ``PhysxCfg(gpu_max_num_partitions=1)`` 作为临时解决办法。对于受管理的 "
"PhysX :class:`~isaaclab.assets.Articulation` 资产，Isaac Lab 检测到上述已知条件时会记录警告。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:45
msgid "Sensor readings are stale immediately after a reset"
msgstr "重置后立即读取传感器，数据仍是旧值"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Affects:** ``physics=isaacsim_physx``, ``physics=ovphysx``, and any RTX-"
"based renderer."
msgstr ""
"**受影响范围：** ``physics=isaacsim_physx`` 、 ``physics=ovphysx`` 及所有基于 RTX 的渲染器。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:49
msgid ""
"Many physics engines do a simulation step as a two-level call: ``forward()``"
" and ``simulate()``, where the kinematic and dynamic states are updated "
"respectively. PhysX has only a single ``step()`` call where the two "
"operations are combined. Because of computations through GPU kernels, it is "
"not straightforward to split them. As a result, writing a root or joint "
"state does not by itself run a full forward pass."
msgstr ""
"许多物理引擎把一次仿真步分成 ``forward()`` 和 ``simulate()`` 两次调用，分别更新运动学状态和动力学状态。PhysX "
"只有一个 ``step()`` 调用，将这两项操作合在一起。由于相关计算通过 GPU "
"核函数完成，两者不易拆开。因此，写入根状态或关节状态本身并不会执行一次完整的前向计算。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:55
msgid ""
"For **articulation link poses** this is handled: reading "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationData.body_link_pose_w` (or the "
"deprecated :attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationData.body_state_w`) triggers "
"a PhysX kinematic update, so link poses reflect a preceding root-state or "
"joint-state write without an intervening ``step()``."
msgstr ""
"对于 **关节体连杆位姿** ，这一问题已得到处理：读取 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationData.body_link_pose_w` （或已弃用的 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.assets.ArticulationData.body_state_w` ）会触发 PhysX "
"运动学更新，因此即使没有在中间调用 ``step()`` ，连杆位姿也能反映此前写入的根状态或关节状态。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:61
msgid ""
"For **RTX rendering-based sensors** — cameras in particular — the data is "
"still not refreshed by a state write. The rendering engine update is bundled"
" with the simulator's ``step()`` call, so the sensor data is only refreshed "
"when the simulation is stepped forward, and a read taken between a reset and"
" the next step returns the previous frame."
msgstr ""
"对于 **基于 RTX 渲染的传感器** ，尤其是相机，写入状态仍不会刷新数据。渲染引擎更新与仿真器的 ``step()`` "
"调用绑定，只有仿真向前推进时才会刷新传感器数据。因此，在重置后、下一步仿真前读取的数据仍是上一帧。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:66
msgid ""
"There is currently no direct workaround for the sensor case. From our "
"experience, the reset values affect agent learning in proportion to how "
"frequently the environment terminates; as an agent learns successfully, the "
"termination rate drops and the effect becomes less significant."
msgstr ""
"目前，传感器这一情况还没有直接的解决办法。根据我们的经验，重置时的旧值对智能体学习的影响与环境终止频率有关；随着智能体逐渐学会任务，终止频率下降，这种影响也会减弱。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:71
msgid "Exiting the process"
msgstr "退出进程"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:73
msgid "**Affects:** ``physics=isaacsim_physx``."
msgstr "**受影响范围：** ``physics=isaacsim_physx`` 。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:75
msgid ""
"When exiting a process with ``Ctrl+C``, occasionally the below error may "
"appear:"
msgstr "当使用 ``Ctrl+C`` 退出进程时，偶尔会出现以下错误: "

#: source/refs/issues.rst:81
msgid ""
"This is due to the termination occurring in the middle of a physics event "
"call and should not affect the functionality of Isaac Lab. It is safe to "
"ignore the error message and continue with terminating the process. On "
"Windows systems, please use ``Ctrl+Break`` or ``Ctrl+fn+B`` to terminate the"
" process."
msgstr ""
"这是因为终止发生在物理事件调用中间，不应影响 Isaac Lab 的功能。可以安全地忽略错误消息并继续终止进程。在 Windows 系统上，请使用 "
"``Ctrl+Break`` 或 ``Ctrl+fn+B`` 来终止进程。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:88
msgid "Newton backends"
msgstr "Newton 后端"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:91
msgid "OpenUSD can crash while parsing collider-rich rigid bodies"
msgstr "OpenUSD 解析含大量碰撞体的刚体时可能崩溃"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:93
msgid ""
"**Affects:** Kitless Newton workflows using OpenUSD releases earlier than "
"26.05, and Isaac Sim releases earlier than 6.1. Isaac Sim 6.1 and later "
"contain the upstream fix in their bundled OpenUSD runtime."
msgstr ""
"**受影响范围：** 使用早于 26.05 的 OpenUSD 版本且不依赖 Kit 的 Newton 工作流，以及早于 6.1 的 Isaac Sim"
" 版本。Isaac Sim 6.1 及后续版本所附带的 OpenUSD 运行时已包含上游修复。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:97
msgid ""
"Older OpenUSD releases have a thread-safety issue in "
"``UsdPhysics.LoadUsdPhysicsFromRange`` when multiple colliders belong to the"
" same rigid body. Newton uses this API while importing a USD stage, so "
"affected processes can terminate during scene creation with a segmentation "
"fault, access violation, heap-corruption message, or hang. The issue and "
"upstream fix are described in `OpenUSD PR #4002`_."
msgstr ""
"旧版 OpenUSD 的 ``UsdPhysics.LoadUsdPhysicsFromRange`` "
"存在线程安全问题：多个碰撞体属于同一刚体时可能触发此问题。Newton 导入 USD 舞台时会调用这一 "
"API，因此受影响的进程可能在创建场景时因段错误、访问冲突、堆损坏报错而退出，或陷入挂起。问题及上游修复详见 `OpenUSD PR #4002`_ 。"

#: source/refs/issues.rst:105
msgid ""
"For kitless workflows, Isaac Lab obtains the ``pxr`` modules from ``usd-"
"exchange``. ``usd-exchange`` and ``usd-core`` are alternative Python "
"distributions of the same OpenUSD runtime and should not be installed "
"together because both provide ``pxr``. They use different distribution "
"version schemes: for example, ``usd-exchange==3.0.0`` provides OpenUSD "
"26.08. Isaac Sim instead uses its own Kit-bundled OpenUSD runtime."
msgstr ""
"对于不依赖 Kit 的工作流，Isaac Lab 从 ``usd-exchange`` 获取 ``pxr`` 模块。 ``usd-exchange`` "
"和 ``usd-core`` 是同一 OpenUSD 运行时的两种 Python 发行包，都提供 ``pxr`` "
"，因此不应同时安装。两者的发行包版本编号不同：例如， ``usd-exchange==3.0.0`` 提供的是 OpenUSD 26.08。Isaac "
"Sim 则使用随 Kit 附带的 OpenUSD 运行时。"

