msgid ""
"This environment variable limits OpenUSD's process-wide worker pool to one "
"thread and can reduce USD import performance. Use it only with affected "
"runtimes, and remove it after upgrading to an OpenUSD provider that contains"
" the fix or to Isaac Sim 6.1 or later."
